			],
			"Message": "chore(submodules): Update Cocoon and Wind submodules to latest commits\n\nThis commit updates the Cocoon and Wind submodules to their latest versions, bringing significant improvements to the CodeEditorLand ecosystem:\n\n- **Cocoon**: Adds configuration service implementation for the extension host, following VSCode's IConfigurationService interface. The service manages configuration settings across APPLICATION, WORKSPACE, and PROFILE scopes, providing foundation for extension configuration management with support for nested keys, scope-based settings, and Mountain integration via IPC/gRPC.\n\n- **Wind**: Introduces MountainWindSync service for real-time synchronization between Wind frontend and Mountain backend, featuring bidirectional communication, configuration sync, and error handling with retry mechanisms. Also enhances WindInstantiationService with advanced disposal patterns, performance tracking, and robust error handling including circuit breaker patterns and fallback dependencies.\n\nThese updates strengthen the configuration management capabilities and real-time synchronization infrastructure, improving the overall reliability and integration between components.",
			"SHA": "eb1e438b5eb6ae3831a4bfee2000d770e16dee68"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-01-28T05:54:03Z",
			"File": [
				"⠇⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				28,
				2
			],
			"Message": "chore(submodules): Update Mountain and Wind submodules to latest commits\n\nThis commit updates the Mountain and Wind submodules to their latest versions, bringing new features and improvements:\n\n- **Mountain**: Introduces advanced synchronization capabilities for real-time collaboration with Wind, including document and UI state synchronization, real-time update broadcasting, and Tauri commands for frontend integration.\n\n- **Wind**: Adds Tauri configuration and workbench services, enabling desktop integration with scope-based configuration and workbench layout management, along with enhanced service instantiation.\n\nThese updates enhance the collaborative editing features and desktop integration capabilities of the CodeEditorLand ecosystem.",
			"SHA": "2ec6e51bcddef9824a1c4dffffbeb8cb9d9b45d7"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-01-28T05:45:50Z",
			"File": [
				"⡟⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				28,
				4
			],
			"Message": "chore(submodules): Update all submodules to latest commits\n\nThis commit updates all submodules to their latest versions, bringing significant improvements across the CodeEditorLand ecosystem:\n\n- **Cocoon**: Adds comprehensive next session implementation plan (NEXT-SESSION-PLAN.md) detailing priorities and workflow for VSCode source analysis, service implementation, and Mountain integration. Updates progress tracking to reflect current foundation establishment.\n\n- **Mountain**: Introduces advanced IPC features module with performance monitoring, real-time collaboration session management, and intelligent message caching. Adds Tauri commands for frontend integration and background monitoring tasks.\n\n- **Wind**: Implements WindInstantiationService dependency injection framework for VSCode workbench integration, featuring service collection management, dependency graph resolution, and performance tracing capabilities.\n\n- **Maintain**: Internal improvements and updates.\n\nThese updates enhance the architectural foundation, improve synchronization between components, and add advanced features for performance monitoring and collaboration capabilities.",
			"SHA": "3218a813e5ba31f114532420f21bc2ac598be166"
		},
